==== USB 3.x problems ====
  - tested with 18.06.2
  - against a original samsung 128 GB flash drive, USB 3.1 capable
  - test command: ''sync ; time sh -c 'dd if=/dev/zero bs=16M count=64 > /dev/sda ; sync'''
  - syslog: ''xhci-mtk 1e1c0000.xhci: Timeout while waiting for setup device command''
  - on a PC this stick is capable of 20 MB/s writing (probably more)
  - against an old 8 GB Kingston DT 101 II => no errors with 2.3 MB/s

**Summary:** USB 3.x is not reliable, didn't test with stock firmware

